 \"전달된 응답이 없다. 취소 요청 접수, 종료 미확인, 보고서 계속 실행이라는 필수 사실을 실제로 전달하지 않았다.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"reactions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"I-S4-03-1\",\n      \"first_actual_publication_id\": null,\n      \"valid_publication_id\": null,\n      \"first_actual_core_quote\": null,\n      \"valid_core_quote\": null,\n      \"wrong_first\": false,\n      \"evidence\": [\"E11422\"],\n      \"reason\": \"요청 실패 후 실제 응답 publication이 없다.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"cycle\": {\n    \"valid_publication_id\": null,\n    \"valid_core_quote\": null,\n    \"evidence\": [\"E11422\"],\n    \"reason\": \"명세된 취소 접수 및 미확인 상태를 전달한 publication이 없어 사이클 완료가 입증되지 않았다.\"\n  },\n  \"critical_violations\": [],\n  \"uncertain\": false\n}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0954d04f8fa69271016acc2174a79c87d0bdfbb04995a056f1","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"high","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_object"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":4116,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":4113,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1160,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":516},"total_tokens":5276},"user":null}
